mxbville:gui.letter_reply.ambush.0=You may think you're clever, but we are always one step ahead. There is nowhere to hide from our reach. And you will experience this first-hand!
mxbville:gui.letter_reply.ambush.1=We know who you are, and we know what you're up to. Consider this letter a warning. Get out of this land or feel the consequences! 
mxbville:gui.letter_reply.ambush.2=Heed this warning, for it is the last you shall receive. Leave this place and never come back. Or we will come back, again and again... for you!
mxbville:gui.letter_reply.ambush.3=So you are inviting new citizens?! I think me and the boys will pay your little settlement a visit. Prepare your gold!
mxbville:gui.letter_reply.ambush.4=It seams to me, your havent payed your toll to build on this ground. Let us remind you kindly to to catch up on this. 
mxbville:gui.letter_reply.ambush.5=Your invitation is in good hands. Unfortunately these hands are now cut of. Someone was unwilling to pay, you see. We hope you dont repeat this mistake.
mxbville:gui.letter_reply.ambush.6=Unfortunately your guest cant reply to your invitation. He somehow lost his head on the way to the mailbox. A fate you will share if you dont leave right away
mxbville:gui.letter_reply.ambush.7=You dare to cross our path and believe you can escape unscathed? We shall make you pay dearly for your insolence! In blood or in gold, you decide!
mxbville:gui.letter_reply.ambush.8=Prepare yourself, for your settlement is about to crumble. And when we are finished with it, you will be next!
mxbville:gui.letter_reply.ambush.9=Don't take it personal. Let's just say your wealth attracts certain unpleasant individuals. But we will gladly free you from this burden!
