mxbville:gui.villager.farmer.kind.greeting.3=Well, hello there! If you're looking for a taste of the countryside, you've come to the right place.
mxbville:gui.villager.farmer.kind.greeting.4=Good day to you! Welcome to my humble farm.


mxbville:gui.villager.blacksmith.kind.greeting.0=Greetings, §o%s! If you seek quality craftsmanship, you've come to the right place.
