mxbville:gui.villager.blacksmith.kind.greeting.3=Hail, adventurer! Forging is my game. If you need equipment that won't fail you, you've come to the right place, 
mxbville:gui.villager.blacksmith.kind.greeting.4=Well met, friend! Look around. I'm sure, I have just the thing you need. 

